TI  - Integrating vision transformers with multi-criteria analysis for direct air capture and CO2 storage (DACCS) siting
T2  - CARBON CAPTURE SCIENCE & TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - DACCS site selection
KW  - PESTLE analysis
KW  - Multi-criteria decision making (MCDM)
