TI  - Diagnosis and staging of mild cognitive impairment, using a modification of the clinical dementia rating scale: the mCDR
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF GERIATRIC PSYCHIATRY
LA  - English
KW  - dementia
KW  - clinical rating scale
KW  - mild cognitive impairment
