TI  - A high-resolution coupled physical-biogeochemical model of the northeastern US continental shelf: MOM6-COBALT-NEUS25v1.0
T2  - GEOSCIENTIFIC MODEL DEVELOPMENT
LA  - English
KW  - NORTHWEST ATLANTIC-OCEAN
KW  - MIXED-LAYER EDDIES
