AB  - Mobile CSCW is such a significant progress by coalescing mobile device application with CSCW, that it extends the category of collaboration modes. Mobile cooperative document reviewing system (MCDR) was developed to review official documents by handsets collaborating with computer. In this paper, we analyzed the characters, especial awareness and self-adaptation, built up a system model of mobile CSCW, and discuss about mobile information security technology. Simultaneity, based on our analysis and discussion, MCDR system is introduced.
