TI  - Heterogeneity-assisted carbon dioxide storage in marine sediments
T2  - APPLIED ENERGY
LA  - English
KW  - CO2 storage
KW  - Marine sediment
KW  - Heterogeneity-assisted trapping
KW  - GULF-OF-MEXICO
KW  - CO2 STORAGE
KW  - OIL-RECOVERY
