TI  - Operational-space wrench and acceleration capability analysis for multi-link cable-driven robots
T2  - SCIENCE CHINA-TECHNOLOGICAL SCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - multi-link cable-driven robots
KW  - operational space
KW  - capability analysis
KW  - zonotope
